      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-09-05T18:17:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m open to killing this method altogether, since we only use it in one place (normally we should use `toBluetoothDevice()`).\n\nI don\u0027t like the old `decodeToString()` and `toByteArray()` methods on primitive types since they overrode the actual encode/decode extension functions in stdlib.",
      "revId": "26f2aaf62a46d8041e210a9848ad8e8302cb3a16",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
